{"id":"cd6e5740589293c9","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-slalom.md","title":"Finite Slalom Condition","display":"df-slalom — Finite Slalom Condition","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-slalom","aliases":["58-df-slalom"],"display":"df-slalom — Finite Slalom Condition","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-slalom"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-slalom</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-slalom — Finite Slalom Condition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,\\lambda,s\\in V\">\\(\\kappa,\\lambda,s\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SlalomCondition}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{SlalomCondition}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}slalom\\text{-}condition}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SlalomCondition}_S(s,\\kappa,\\lambda)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{dom}(s)\\subseteq\\kappa\n\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(\\operatorname{dom}(s))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(s,\\operatorname{dom}(s),\\lambda).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}slalom\\text{-}condition}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SlalomCondition}_S(s,\\kappa,\\lambda)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{dom}(s)\\subseteq\\kappa\n\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(\\operatorname{dom}(s))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(s,\\operatorname{dom}(s),\\lambda).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}slalom}\\vdash\n\\mathbb S_\\kappa(\\lambda)\n\\coloneqq\n\\{s\\in V:\\mathrm{SlalomCondition}_S(s,\\kappa,\\lambda)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}slalom}\\vdash\n\\mathbb S_\\kappa(\\lambda)\n\\coloneqq\n\\{s\\in V:\\mathrm{SlalomCondition}_S(s,\\kappa,\\lambda)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This file formalizes finite partial functions from <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span>, matching its original formula.</li>\n<li>Localization slaloms of the form <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s:\\omega\\to[\\omega]^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(s:\\omega\\to[\\omega]^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> with a width bound are a different notion and require a separate predicate.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa,\\lambda,s\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Finite}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SlalomCondition}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}slalom\\text{-}condition}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SlalomCondition}_S(s,\\kappa,\\lambda)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{dom}(s)\\subseteq\\kappa\n\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(\\operatorname{dom}(s))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(s,\\operatorname{dom}(s),\\lambda).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}slalom}\\vdash\n\\mathbb S_\\kappa(\\lambda)\n\\coloneqq\n\\{s\\in V:\\mathrm{SlalomCondition}_S(s,\\kappa,\\lambda)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"s:\\omega\\to[\\omega]^{<\\omega}","display":false}],"bytes":1129,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1188","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-slalom.md|58-df-slalom]]（batch10）"}],"outgoing":["36d7463d215be751","d9a25b0ac94a3598"]}